<cell>Each vector field shown represents the force on a particle
at different points in the plane as a result of another particle
at the origin.  Match each vector field with its description.
<ol>
<li>
An attractive force whose magnitude decreases as distance increases.
</li>
<li>
A repulsive force whose magnitude increases as distance increases.
</li>
<li>
A repulsive force whose magnitude decreases as distance increases.
</li>
<li>
An attractive force whose magnitude increases as distance increases.
</li>
</ol></cell>
